## API Documentation

This project uses **Swagger/OpenAPI** for API documentation and testing.

After running the application, open the Swagger interface in your browser using the URL displayed in the application output.

Swagger allows you to:

* View available API endpoints
* Test HTTP requests
* View request parameters
* View response formats
* Test CRUD operations

